# Canonical project bootstrap

The workspace root is Bot Chassis (`C:\Python\bot_chassis`). This is the frame, not a bot body. Do not edit PsyBot (`C:\Python\tg_psy_tests`) or Chat Listener (`C:\Python\tg_chat_listener`) from this root. Do not switch the Profiling Framework checkout.

Read in this order before planning or changing code:

1. `.agents/NEW_CHAT.md`
2. `AGENTS.md` for project and control-plane rules
3. `.agents/SESSION_STATE.md`
4. `.agents/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`
5. `.agents/ACTIVE_PLANS.md`
6. `.agents/TASK_TODO.md` — the live task queue
7. `.agents/UPGRADE_0_3_PLAN.md` for any `0.3` Gate
8. `docs/CHASSIS.md` for the public contract
9. `.agents/PROJECT_LOG.md` — only the latest relevant entries

Honor the explicit user command. Do not start a Gate until the owner confirms that Gate.

Do not create alternate state, TODO, log, or bootstrap files. Allowed living files: `.agents/SESSION_STATE.md`, `.agents/TASK_TODO.md`, `.agents/PROJECT_LOG.md`, `VERSION_LOG.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`.
